      <title>A CPU that runs entirely on GPU</title>
      <link>https://github.com/robertcprice/nCPU</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Every ALU operation is a trained neural network. Bitwise ops use neural truth tables. Carry-lookahead works in neural networks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47243069"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HN Discussion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://github.com/robertcprice/nCPU'&gt;Read Original Article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top 6 Comments:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nicman23:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;can i run linux on a nvidia card though?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;bmc7505:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;As foretold six years ago. [1]&lt;p&gt;[1]: &lt;a href="https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;breandan.net&amp;#x2F;2020&amp;#x2F;06&amp;#x2F;30&amp;#x2F;graph-computation#roadmap" rel="nofollow"&gt;https:&amp;#x2F;&amp;#x2F;breandan.net&amp;#x2F;2020&amp;#x2F;06&amp;#x2F;30&amp;#x2F;graph-computation#roadmap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Surac:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Well GPU are just special purpous CPU.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sudo_cowsay:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;&amp;quot;Multiplication is 12x faster than addition...&amp;quot;&lt;p&gt;Wow. That&amp;#x27;s cool but what happens to the regular CPU?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;lorenzohess:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Out of curiosity, how much slower is this than an actual CPU?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin: 10px 0; padding: 10px; background: #f6f6f6; border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RagnarD:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0;"&gt;Being able to perform precise math in an LLM is important, glad to see this.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
